    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# PRJ001 - Tool - Find Next Available Slot\n\n**Purpose:** Finds the earliest available appointment slot within a specified number of calendar days.\n\n**Inputs:** `appointment_type`, `max_days`\n\n**Process:**\n1. Validate appointment type and search range.\n2. Generate working dates using shared Configuration.\n3. Check each date sequentially using Find Available Slots Within a Date.\n4. Return the earliest available slot or an error if none is found.\n\n**Important:** `max_days` includes today and counts calendar days. This workflow only checks availability; it does not book appointments. Availability is rechecked during booking.\n\n**Dependencies:** Configuration and Find Available Slots Within a Date.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 1008,
        "color": 4
      },
